This repository mixes Mitchell Vizensky's own Mac port code with Just One Boss,
which belongs to its creator. Only the first part is licensed here.

1. MIT LICENCE: the Macintosh port layer

   src/mac_display.c/.h, src/mac_input.c/.h, src/mac_main.c, src/mac_prefs.c,
   src/mac_audio.c/.h, src/p8.c/.h, tools/ (except tools/fontdata_pico8_cc0.cpp,
   and not their generated output), CMakeLists.txt, *.r, build.sh and the documentation.

