2. NOT LICENSED HERE: Just One Boss

   Just One Boss (game design, code, art, music and sound) is by Ayla Nonsense
   (bridgs): https://bridgs.itch.io/just-one-boss. This port was made with her
   permission. src/game.c/.h, src/entities.c/.h, src/engine.c/.h and src/util.c/.h
   are translated from the game's own code, and everything in src/generated/ is
   converted from its cartridge, as are the built JustOneBoss.bin and JustOneBoss.dsk.
   None of these are covered by the MIT licence above; they remain hers.

   src/p8_font.h and tools/fontdata_pico8_cc0.cpp are the PICO-8 system font,
   CC0 by Lexaloffle.
